; claude: compression, from scratch: Huffman codes, DEFLATE (LZ77 +
; Huffman, RFC 1951) and its zlib wrapper (RFC 1950), with their
; checksums -- what PNG's pixels are compressed with, and what JPEG's
; Huffman codes share (see notes_images.md, sections 2, 3 and 6); LZW,
; GIF's; and the pieces of MPEG's bitstreams, a reader of bits most
; significant first (Bits) and fixed code tables (Vlc). Independent of
; any format, so that audio's may use them as images' and videos' do.
; A private library, installed as part of elm_playground, pure OCaml.
(library
 (name compression)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
)
